          "jcr:created": "Tue Dec 19 2023 15:20:25 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h2><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Stair-PRO at a glance</span></span></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><b>Model number: 6252</b></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Our stair chair utilizes our innovative Stair-TREAD system, which allows caregivers to transport patients down stairs without lifting.</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Shown to help reduce the risk for operator injury</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Adjustable handles, track angle and built-in descent control enhance safety</span></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Dec 22 2023 16:30:33 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
